# World gates — do not abort in-app flows

## Intent

`MainWorldGate` blocks **confirmed** restaurant-only accounts on aurent.uz. That is product intent.

## Do not regress

1. **Never** set `loading=true` on revalidation after the user was already allowed — remounting `AppRoutes` aborts file pick / Excel import / open dialogs.
2. On **`/company-business-types` transport error**: do **not** logout an already-allowed session. First paint may fail-open; only deny when the API returns an explicit restaurant-only payload (or floor role).
3. `companyFitsMainApp(null)` is **unknown** (`null`), not `false`. Gate handles unknown; do not map unknown → `restaurant_only` logout.

## Tests

- `mainAppAccess.test.js` — null payload → `reason: 'unknown'`; pharmacy/grocery still ok.
